# === Dart / pub workspace ===
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
build/
**/doc/api/
# Git keeps the root pubspec.lock. This makes the workspace resolution reproducible.
# The workspace members have no pubspec.lock.
packages/*/pubspec.lock

# === Rust ===
**/target/
# Git keeps Cargo.lock. This makes the native library builds reproducible.

# === FRB output (Git keeps these files) ===
# Git keeps packages/iroh_quic/lib/src/rust/** and rust/**/src/frb_generated.rs.
# Thus users of the packages do not run the codegen.

# === Vendored crate copy ===
# packages/iroh_flutter/rust is a committed mirror of packages/iroh_quic/rust.
# cargokit needs the crate in the plugin directory.
# `dart pub publish` does not include ignored files. Thus Git must keep the mirror.
# Run `tool/sync_native.sh` to update the mirror. CI makes sure that the mirror is current.
# Git ignores only the build output of the mirror (the `**/target/` rule above).

# === Plugin and example app: generated files, local machine files, native build output ===
